paragraph_text:
PNWGmc *baugijana ‘to bend (it)’ (ON beygja, OF beia, OS bogian, OHG bougen
‘to incline’) > *béagjan > WS biegan, Kent. bégan (in ge-bégod ‘(s)he bends’),
North. béga;

